WEBVTT

00:28:58.663 --> 00:29:00.329
I just realized the number,

00:29:00.329 --> 00:29:04.371
like the dollar numbers that I would have
to ask for to make meaningful progress,

00:29:04.371 --> 00:29:07.038
given all the challenges, combined with

00:29:07.038 --> 00:29:12.121
the risk that we would not achieve our
goals because of all of the complexity

00:29:12.121 --> 00:29:17.663
and the unknowns, even with the five
dollars a gallon example by when. Right.

00:29:17.746 --> 00:29:20.913
It's possible we'll get there by 2050.

00:29:21.246 --> 00:29:24.121
But clearly that's not what
the kill signal meant.

00:29:26.871 --> 00:29:28.413
It felt like wishful thinking.

00:29:28.454 --> 00:29:30.163
You know, it's like in my heart of hearts,